{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/b0e4039cddb1f39d1a38d02e3487287d.avif?t=1763979623\" width=620 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We want freedom, not slavery,&quot; the goblin muttered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the goblin's declaration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once just an experience fodder at the bottom of another world, now he is determined to challenge the princesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though it won't be easy, with the blessing of the Nature Goddess, he has been granted the &quot;Power of Rebirth.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So make good use of this power, and in the endless cycles of reincarnation, defeat each princess to find a way to regain freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/3adf75baf0800ce30967ceea254d7c64.poster.avif?t=1763979623\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/3adf75baf0800ce30967ceea254d7c64.webm?t=1763979623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565010/extras/aaa5a077a976ffa0bb39a7f52be51eb9.avif?t=1763979623\" width=620 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple and relaxing idle game. Under your guidance, everything will happen naturally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have prepared numerous CG endings, waiting for you to discover as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i